# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Docs:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Scripts and styles were sent with max-age 14400 (4 h), so a visitor could
# run old code for hours after a deploy, and old and new modules could mix
# (FINDINGS, Site cache headers). Revalidate every file on every load
# instead, as the HTML and JSON files already were; the ETag makes an
# unchanged file a short 304 answer.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
